  m_text: "Albert \"Windyshine\" Chen\r\nAndy Tang 唐安迪\r\nChloé Streck\r\nAlessio Strano\r\nTamara Katherina Neiß\r\nAdrián Marinero García\r\nFlorencia Orsetti\r\nSaori Kitagawa\r\nHyoJu Lee (Tressia Lee)\r\nŁukasz Biedrzycki\r\nGabriel Pergher Turcato\r\nOleksii Shchurov\r\nYusuf Yılgör\r\nYuliia Tatsenko"
